SUMMARY:VIENNA DECAY NIGHT (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Viper Room
DESCRIPTION: VIENNA DECAY NIGHT – AUTUMN 2026 EDITION Start your Halloween preparation season with us in Viper Room\, 26.09.2026 Doors 22:00 Live: PSYCHOFORMALINA {PL} Psychoformalina are coldwave / post-punk masters from Wroclaw (Poland) with truly mezmerizing live performances\, where tribal rhythms and growling bass put you in a trance. Their latest album to date „Chimera“ was released by Bat-cave productions in 2024. Psychoformalina are extensively touring and we are happy to finally make this show happen. Give them a follow and grab some records in advance! https://psychoformalina.bandcamp.com/ https://www.youtube.com/psychoformalina https://www.facebook.com/psychoformalina  Afterparty with VDK DJ Line: Darktunes Plasmatic Legion Special Guest DJs: Woodraf & Justine (Return to the batcave / Bat-cave productions / PL) Tomasz Woodraf is the man behind record label Bat-cave productions and the „Return to the batcave“ festival. Without exaggeration\, he is one of the main people keeping the deathrock and post-punk underground alive. Abendkasse: €16  
URL:https://www.viper-room.at/events/vienna-decay-night-0926
